| `KEEL_CANARY_SCRATCH` | path | unset: `config/project.json` `canary.scratch_root` (`.canary`) | a path with no `..` part, relative to the checkout and ignored by git, or absolute; never under the system temporary directory | `scripts/canary.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `canary.scratch_root` row | Moves where the canary renders, such as onto a farm node's local disk; a refused value is exit 14 before anything renders. | the audit's scratch, a temporary directory `scripts/audit_project.py` removes | always |
